  "stem": "Sam said at noon, \"I am working now.\" A report was written that evening. Which word should the evening report use for now?",
  "options": [
    "soon",
    "then",
    "outside",
    "tomorrow"
  ],
  "answerIndex": 1,
  "optionRationales": [
    {
      "optionIndex": 0,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "soon 表示不久後，並非原來正在工作的時刻。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 1,
      "isCorrect": true,
      "reason": "then 可指 Sam 中午說話時的那一刻。"
    },
    {
